  {
   "id": "b12-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 128,
   "width": 543,
   "height": 28,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The rule: three checks for each Y in Q-space",
   "originalText": "The rule: three checks for each Y in Q-space",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b12-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 837,
   "height": 113,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1  the tunnel to Y avoids E (node P-space):\n     S’s own path:  dist(S,Y) < dist(S,E) + dist(E,Y)\n     or via N ≠ E:  dist(N,Y) < dist(N,E) + dist(E,Y)  and  dist(N,Y) < dist(N,S) + dist(S,Y)\n2  Y’s own path to D avoids E:  dist(Y,D) < dist(Y,E) + dist(E,D)\n3  Y doesn’t have the overload bit\nbest = lowest cost from S (cheapest way in of check 1), then lowest router id",
   "originalText": "1  the tunnel to Y avoids E (node P-space):\n     S’s own path:  dist(S,Y) < dist(S,E) + dist(E,Y)\n     or via N ≠ E:  dist(N,Y) < dist(N,E) + dist(E,Y)  and  dist(N,Y) < dist(N,S) + dist(S,Y)\n2  Y’s own path to D avoids E:  dist(Y,D) < dist(Y,E) + dist(E,D)\n3  Y doesn’t have the overload bit\nbest = lowest cost from S (cheapest way in of check 1), then lowest router id",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b12-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 289,
   "width": 962,
   "height": 85,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  Link mode only asks that the repair avoid the link S–E. If router E fails, the PQ node’s path to D\n   may still run through E.\n•  Check 2 depends on D, so node mode is worked out per (D, link) and only when D ≠ E.\n•  Ties count as \"may use E\", as in B5.",
   "originalText": "•  Link mode only asks that the repair avoid the link S–E. If router E fails, the PQ node’s path to D\n   may still run through E.\n•  Check 2 depends on D, so node mode is worked out per (D, link) and only when D ≠ E.\n•  Ties count as \"may use E\", as in B5.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b12-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 384,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Worked checks (from the engine)",
   "originalText": "Worked checks (from the engine)",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b12-text-15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 418,
   "width": 672,
   "height": 158,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 118785,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1570935,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Case          Y     1 tunnel avoids E          2 path to D avoids E   Result\n------------  ----  -------------------------  ---------------------  ----------\n§8.1 ring     B     own: 2 < 1 + 2 = 3   ✓     3 < 2 + 1 = 3   ✗      ✗\n  S → D       C     via A: 2 < 2 + 1 = 3 ✓     2 < 1 + 1 = 2   ✗      ✗\n              D     own: 2 < 1 + 1 = 2   ✗     –                      ✗\n8  S → D      B     via N: 3 < 4 + 1 = 5 ✓     3 < 1 + 2 = 3   ✗      ✗\n              C     via N: 6 < 4 + 4 = 8 ✓     3 < 4 + 2 = 6   ✓      ✓ cost 8\n              D     own 4 < 4 ✗, N 6 < 6 ✗     –                      ✗\n4  PE1 → P3   PE2   via P2: 20 < 20+20 ✓       10 < 20 + 10 = 30  ✓   ✓ cost 30",
   "originalText": "Case          Y     1 tunnel avoids E          2 path to D avoids E   Result\n------------  ----  -------------------------  ---------------------  ----------\n§8.1 ring     B     own: 2 < 1 + 2 = 3   ✓     3 < 2 + 1 = 3   ✗      ✗\n  S → D       C     via A: 2 < 2 + 1 = 3 ✓     2 < 1 + 1 = 2   ✗      ✗\n              D     own: 2 < 1 + 1 = 2   ✗     –                      ✗\n8  S → D      B     via N: 3 < 4 + 1 = 5 ✓     3 < 1 + 2 = 3   ✗      ✗\n              C     via N: 6 < 4 + 4 = 8 ✓     3 < 4 + 2 = 6   ✓      ✓ cost 8\n              D     own 4 < 4 ✗, N 6 < 6 ✗     –                      ✗\n4  PE1 → P3   PE2   via P2: 20 < 20+20 ✓       10 < 20 + 10 = 30  ✓   ✓ cost 30",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b12-text-16",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 586,
   "width": 815,
   "height": 88,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 126704,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1675664,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Case         Link PQ (B11)   Node PQ   Used               What happens if E fails (A9)\n-----------  --------------  --------  -----------------  -----------------------------------\n§8.1 ring    {B, C}, B       {}        B (link fallback)  breaks at C; C’s LFA D saves it, cost 7\n8            {B, C}, B       {C}       C via N, cost 8    S → N → B → C → D (11) survives\n4 PE1→P3     {PE2}           {PE2}     PE2 via P2         the same node either way",
   "originalText": "Case         Link PQ (B11)   Node PQ   Used               What happens if E fails (A9)\n-----------  --------------  --------  -----------------  -----------------------------------\n§8.1 ring    {B, C}, B       {}        B (link fallback)  breaks at C; C’s LFA D saves it, cost 7\n8            {B, C}, B       {C}       C via N, cost 8    S → N → B → C → D (11) survives\n4 PE1→P3     {PE2}           {PE2}     PE2 via P2         the same node either way",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
