  {
   "id": "b12-text-49",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 859,
   "width": 407,
   "height": 28,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 388031,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5131721,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Stricter than the RFC, on purpose",
   "originalText": "Stricter than the RFC, on purpose",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b12-text-50",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 897,
   "width": 486,
   "height": 85,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 395950,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5236450,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "RFC 8102 §2.2.6.2 states only the first test via N.\nWe also keep the link rule dist(N,Y) < dist(N,S) +\ndist(S,Y), so the tunnel never comes back through S\n(D17).",
   "originalText": "RFC 8102 §2.2.6.2 states only the first test via N.\nWe also keep the link rule dist(N,Y) < dist(N,S) +\ndist(S,Y), so the tunnel never comes back through S\n(D17).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b12-text-51",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 992,
   "width": 457,
   "height": 20,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 403869,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5341179,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Keeping both is stricter, never looser (§3.1, D51).",
   "originalText": "Keeping both is stricter, never looser (§3.1, D51).",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
