   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 475140,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6283740,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Takeaway",
   "originalText": "Takeaway",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b12-text-61",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 1106,
   "width": 1600,
   "height": 43,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 483059,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6388469,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "To survive router E failing, both halves of the repair must avoid E: the tunnel to the PQ node, and the PQ node’s own path to D. In Example 8 that moves the choice from\nB to C. On the §8.1 ring no PQ node passes, so Remote LFA keeps the link-protecting B.",
   "originalText": "To survive router E failing, both halves of the repair must avoid E: the tunnel to the PQ node, and the PQ node’s own path to D. In Example 8 that moves the choice from\nB to C. On the §8.1 ring no PQ node passes, so Remote LFA keeps the link-protecting B.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b12-text-62",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1181,
   "width": 1604,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 490978,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6493198,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Sources: docs/02-algorithms.md §3.1, §8.1 (worked check, ring with D)  ·  docs/learn/05-remote-lfa.md (Node protection)  ·  examples/08-node-protection.yaml, 04-isp-core.yaml with\nprotection: node  ·  checked with computeForSource()",
   "originalText": "Sources: docs/02-algorithms.md §3.1, §8.1 (worked check, ring with D)  ·  docs/learn/05-remote-lfa.md (Node protection)  ·  examples/08-node-protection.yaml, 04-isp-core.yaml with\nprotection: node  ·  checked with computeForSource()",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
